From ff03d3e8781b9cab7a817bf126f04c5f31ebb105 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-port <axon7-port@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:47:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] axon7: device.mk, product and props for lineage-22.2

As msm8996-common 22.2: non_ab_device + qcom-caf common.mk, VINTF kernel
requirements, product inherits moved from lineage_axon7.mk, shipping API
level 25. HALs: audio 6.0 + bluetooth.audio AIDL, camera provider 2.5,
gnss 2.0 qti, health/memtrack/light/usb/wifi on their AIDL services,
drm clearkey AIDL, .vendor variants and vendor compat libs (hidlbase-v32,
protobuf vendorcompat, cutils-v29, utils-v33), cgroups/task profiles,
mountpoint packages, Lineage health. axon7 keeps its amplifier, NFC (NXP)
configs, keylayout, display calibration, FlipFlap, ZteDoze, CNE.
Removed: libhidl/ (22.2 provides android.hidl.base), bluetooth/
(bdroid_buildcfg unused), light/ (HIDL light@2.0; generic Lineage AIDL HAL
drives lcd-backlight and red/green), compatibility_matrix.xml (qcom-caf's),
libui_shim from shims/ (Lineage compat ships it). Touch key disabler HAL
left out until ported to AIDL. vendor_prop.mk split into vendor.prop
(vendor namespaces) and system.prop; product.prop from msm8996-common.
Fingerprint: BuildDesc/BuildFingerprint/DeviceName overrides.
